---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /
title: "Roblox Game Templates & Asset Packs · Viral Templates"
description: "Premium Roblox game templates and asset packs, ready to publish: clean code, polished UI, and the systems you would otherwise spend weeks rebuilding."
hasMarquee: true
hasFaq: true
hasStats: true
faq:
  - q: "Can I customise the template?"
    a: "Yes. All templates are fully customizable in Roblox Studio. You can change assets, UI, scripts, and scale systems to fit your specific needs for your game."
  - q: "I've never released a game before, will I be able to use this template?"
    a: "Absolutely. Whether you're new to Roblox development or experienced, the template is clean, organised, and easy to work with."
  - q: "What happens after I purchase a template?"
    a: "You get instant access to the template after checkout. Download it, open it in Roblox Studio, and release it within a matter of minutes."
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="well">
    <div class="hero__inner">
      <h1 class="display">
        Premium Roblox templates
        <span class="display__grad">&amp; assets, ready to go.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero__sub">
        High-quality, pre-made game templates and assets inspired by current trending and
        viral Roblox games.
      </p>

      <div class="btn-row hero__actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/templates/">
          Browse the collection
          <svg class="btn__arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
               stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="{{ site.discord }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">
          Join the Discord
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="hero__meta">
        {% set fillPercent = (stats.averageOutOf5 / 5 * 100) | round %}
        {% include "components/stars.njk" %}
        <span class="rating__num"><span class="num">{{ stats.averageOutOf5 }}</span> out of 5 from <span class="num">{{ stats.reviewCount }}</span> reviews</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<hr class="hairline">

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <div class="well">
    <div class="section-head section-head--center">
      <h2 class="h2" id="why-title">Tired of rebuilding the same systems again?</h2>
      <p class="sub">
        Every template ships ready to publish. Clean code, polished UI, and the systems
        you'd otherwise spend weeks rebuilding.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="wgrid">
      <div class="wcard reveal">
        <h3 class="wcard__title">Built for success</h3>
        <p class="wcard__body">
          With 5+ years of Roblox development experience, we know what current trends look
          like and what makes games reach the front page.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="wcard reveal">
        <h3 class="wcard__title">Built for efficiency</h3>
        <p class="wcard__body">
          Stop wasting weeks rebuilding the basics. Our templates are ready to launch in
          minutes, so you can focus on reaching the algorithm.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="wcard reveal">
        <h3 class="wcard__title">Built for affordability</h3>
        <p class="wcard__body">
          Premium quality templates without premium agency pricing. Professional results
          at a price that actually makes sense for indie developers.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--flush-top" aria-label="Store facts">
  <div class="well">
    {% include "components/stats.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="collection-title">
  <div class="well">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 class="h2" id="collection-title">Browse the collection.</h2>
      <p class="sub">
        Production-ready templates and asset packs, fully scripted and supported.
        More dropping soon, keep an eye out.
      </p>
    </div>

    {%- set gridProducts = products | byOrder %}
    {% include "components/product-grid.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--flush-top" id="reviews" aria-labelledby="reviews-title">
  <div class="well">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 class="h2" id="reviews-title">What Roblox developers said after buying</h2>
      <div class="rating" style="margin-top: var(--s-5)">
        {% set fillPercent = (stats.averageOutOf5 / 5 * 100) | round %}
        {% include "components/stars.njk" %}
        <span class="rating__num">
          <span class="num">{{ stats.averageOutOf5 }}</span> out of 5 across
          <span class="num">{{ stats.ratedCount }}</span> rated reviews
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {#- The marquee carries all 35 reviews, tier 3 then tier 2 then tier 1, so
      every review is in the DOM exactly once and the reviewCount in the
      AggregateRating matches what is actually on the page. -#}
  {%- set marqueeReviews = (reviews | whereTier(3)) | concatList(reviews | whereTier(2)) | concatList(reviews | whereTier(1)) %}
  {% include "components/reviews-marquee.njk" %}
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="well">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 class="h2" id="faq-title">Questions people ask before buying</h2>
    </div>
    {% set items = faq %}
    {% include "components/faq.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="well">
    <div class="cta-band__inner">
      <div>
        <h2 class="h2">Pick a product and get building</h2>
        <p>A range of products, all professionally built, downloadable immediately.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/templates/">See all three</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="{{ site.discord }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Join the Discord</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
